# AI CLI & Memory Folders
# NOTE: ignore ONLY the local settings, NOT all of .claude/ -- .claude/rules/*.md (13 path-scoped rule
# files) and .claude/settings.json are deliberately TRACKED (see the CLAUDE.md modularization, v2.31.0).
# A blanket `.claude/` would silently stop new rule files from being committed. `.remember/` and
# `.superpowers/` are local skill scratch (never were tracked) -- fine to ignore (confirmed 2026-07-24).
.claude/settings.local.json*
.remember/
.superpowers/


